热门艺术风格）\n\n**输出要求**：\n* 输出一段连贯的英文自然语言，不要分点。\n* **若原图中没有人物，描述中绝不能出现“男人、女人、行人”等词汇。**\n* 字数控制在600字以内。\n只输出英文提示词，不要出现对图像水印的描述，不要出现无关的文字和符号，不需要总结及其他与提示词无关的内容，\n", "images", 24, 256, 58591664802156, "randomize", true, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 50, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "parameters", "link": 51, "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images", "link": 62, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "queue_handler", "label": "queue_handler", "type": "*", "localized_name": "queue_handler"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "system_prompt"}, "name": "system_prompt", "label": "system_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "system_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "inference_mode"}, "name": "inference_mode", "label": "inference_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "inference_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_frames"}, "name": "max_frames", "label": "max_frames", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_frames"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_size"}, "name": "max_size", "label": "max_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "force_offload"}, "name": "force_offload", "label": "force_offload", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "force_offload"}, {"widget": {"name": "save_states"}, "name": "save_states", "label": "save_states", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "save_states"}], "flags": {}, "type": "llama_cpp_instruct_adv", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [428.8862